return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-27T08:44:12+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-27T08:44:12+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','Multilingual WordPress, one post per language: linked translations of posts, pages, categories, media text, widgets and the site title, with your old Tranzly translations imported.'=>'WordPress ti o ni ede pupọ, ifiweranṣẹ kan fun ede kọọkan: awọn itumọ ti a so pọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ, awọn oju-iwe, awọn ẹka, ọrọ media, awọn widget ati akọle aaye, pẹlu awọn atijọ rẹ Tranzly itumọ ti a gbe wọle.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Awọn olupese AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Àwọn adáṣe ChatGPT. Olùrànlọ́wọ́ rere gbogbo-nìṣe.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn tí ó dá Claude. Wọ́n lágbára nínú kíkọ̀ àti àṣàrò dáadáa.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Awọn awoṣe Gemini ti Google. Yara ati gbowolori kekere.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ile-iṣẹ AI kan ti Ilu Yuroopu pẹlu awọn awoṣe ti o yara, ti ko si gbowolori.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe iye owó kékeré tí wọ́n dára nípa kíkọ àti kóòdù.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Bọtini kan fun awọn awoṣe lati ọpọlọpọ awọn olupese oriṣiriṣi.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Èyíkéyìí iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, títí kan àwṣ awoṣe tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọmpútà tàbí sẹ̀fà rẹ.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gbogbo gbogbo (a n lo ti nko ba si ohun pataki miran ti a yan)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kikọ ati tun-kikọ','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu ati CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Má bínú, a kò gbàyín láàyè láti wọ ojúewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Àwọn ètò wònyí jẹ́ pínpín fún gbogbo plọ́gìnnì tó ń lò wọ́n: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Àwọn kọ́ọ̀fù rẹ̀ wà ní ìpamọ́ nínú ibi ìpamọ́ data ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí, wọ́n sì ń lọ sí ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè tí o yàn nìkan ni — kìí ṣe sí wa rárá.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ 1 nínú 2: yan olùpèsè AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O mu bọtọni rẹ wa, nitorina o sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Ko ni idaniloju? Eyikeyi ninu iwọnyi ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Tẹ̀lé e','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Ẹ̀ka Kejì ti Kejì: so %s pọ̀','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Fi adirẹsi iṣẹ ti o ni ibamu pẹlu OpenAI sii, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Bọtini kan nikan ni a nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun ọkan.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí kí o ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ̀lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Da bọtọ́n tuntun kan sẹ́dẹ̀ tẹ́ a sì da ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà náà ko.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Ẹ lẹ mọ́lẹ̀ sí ìsàlẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tẹ "Save and test". A máa ń rán ìbéèrè kékeré kan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn olùpèsè nílò ìdíwọ̀n owó díẹ̀ lórí àkáǹtì náà kí kọ́ọ̀sì kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'fi kun kirẹditi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Adirẹsi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Bọtìnì tí a fi pamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ́ mọ́ títí tí o ó fi fi tuntun rọ́pọ̀ rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Bọtínì (aṣayan)','API key'=>'Bọtìnì API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ kí o sì dán an wò','Providers'=>'Àwọn Olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipo','Key'=>'Bọtìnnì Ìkọkọ','Get a key'=>'Gba bọtọni kan','Test'=>'Àdánwò','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'A ti fipamọ nipasẹ ẹya afikun ti o titun: ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa lẹẹkan si.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Kò ṣe é ṣe láti ṣí kọ́ọ̀sì tí a fi pamọ́ náà mọ́ (àwọn kọ́ọ̀sì ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yí padà). Tẹ́ ẹ̀ sí i lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Not connected'=>'Kò tíì sopọ̀','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti sopọ — ìdánwò tó kẹ́yìn yọrí sí rere %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Idanwo kẹhin kuna: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Asopọ — a ko tii dan wo','Which model to use'=>'Irú àwòṣe wo ni lati lo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ jẹ́ àmì ìṣedúró wa fún iṣẹ́ yẹn. Àtòjọ náà ní gbogbo àwọn àwòṣe tí kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ lè lò, tí a kà ní tààràtà láti ọ̀dọ̀ olùpèsè náà.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A ń gbani nímọ̀ràn fún olùpèsè —','Save models'=>'Ṣe amugbẹ ikojọpọ mọ','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ àwọn àkọ́ṣe àwọn olùpèsè di tuntun','best quality'=>'didẹ julo','lowest cost'=>'idi kekere julọ','fastest'=>'tọ́ jù lọ','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwoṣé kún un fúnra rẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣé a ṣe àwòṣe kan jáde lónìí? Lẹ́ kọ́ orúkọ rẹ̀ gan-an láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orúkọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Fi awoṣe kun','Recommended models list'=>'Àkójọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a gbà níyànjú','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A kò lè fọwọ́ sí àkójọ àwọn àwoṣe tí a ṣeduro rẹ̀, nitorina a kò fi àwọn àbá han. Tun fi sọfitiwia afikun (plugin) sori ẹrọ, tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Àtòkọ tí a ń lò ni a tẹ̀ jáde ní %s. Ìgbékalẹ̀ àfikún kọ̀ọ̀kan mú tuntun wá.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Ẹ tún ṣàyẹ̀wò Zinn Digital® lẹ́ẹ̀kan lọ́jọ́ kan fún àkójọ tí a sọ di tuntun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìgbàsílẹ̀ tí ó rọ̀run nìkan ni a ń ránṣẹ́: kò sí kọ́ọ̀dù, kò sí àdírẹ́sì sítì, kò sí ohun kankan nípa àkóónú rẹ̀. Àkọsílẹ̀ náà ní ìwwé-àṣẹ, a sì máa ǹ fojú fò an àkóónú tí kò bá kọjá àyẹ̀wò ìwé-àṣẹ náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'A yẹ kẹ́yẹ̀ ẹ̀ẹ̀kan kẹ́yẹ̀ %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fipamọ, ki o si ṣayẹwo bẹẹni o ba tan','a newer list was installed'=>'A fi àkójọ tuntun kan sori rẹ̀','already up to date'=>'ti ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'igba ogun (download) na kuna ayewo ibuwọlu ati pe a foju si i','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital®; àkójọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yoo wa ni lílò','turned off'=>'tí a pa kuro','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ̀ ojú-ewé ipò wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojúewé ìwé-owó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú ewé àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ma binu, o ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣe iyẹn.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fún àpẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Iyẹn kọ́ jọ bọtínì API kan. Ṣe àakọ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si, láìsí àlàfo.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Kọ kọ́kọ́ lẹ bọ́kì sínú bọtìnnì API rẹ.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn àpẹẹrẹ náà.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Fi orúkọ gangan awoṣe náà sílẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ bí ìwé ìtọ́nisọ́nà olùpèsè ṣe kọ ọ́.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A ti fi %s kun. Yan ni abẹ́ "Àwoṣe wo lo yẹ lati lo".','Model removed.'=>'A yọ àwọn àwòṣe kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ ojúmọ́ ti wà ní pípa. Àkójọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú plọ́gìn (plugin) náà ni a ń lò.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A túnà kún àwọn àkọsílẹ àwọn àwòṣe náà.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹya tuntun ti ọkan ninu awọn afikun rẹ lo fipamọ bọtini AI rẹ. Ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tun tẹ bọtini naa sii ni awọn eto AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a kò lè ṣí kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI tí o fi pamọ́ mọ́ (àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò ojú-wẹ́bù náà yípadà). Tẹ́ ẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nínú àwọn ètò AI náà.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A ti seto AI sílẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀. Fi bọ́tìnnì kún fún olùpèsè AI kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yàn àwọ̀ pátápátá kan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọkan ninu awọn eto AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Olupese AI yẹn ko ni atilẹyin nipasẹ ẹya yii ti afikun naa.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ojula yii ko le de ọdọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o nṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le de lati ọdọ olupin wẹẹbu rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa rẹ ko le de lati inu aaye ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba wa lori ayelujara, agbalejo rẹ le n dina awọn asopọ ita, tabi adirẹsi na jẹ aṣiṣe.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pé àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò ní kírédìtì tàbí kótà kankan mọ́. Fi kírédìtì kún un tàbí gbé ìwọ̀n rẹ ga nínú àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ pẹ̀lu wọn, lẹ́yìn náà tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ. Ó ṣe é kí a ti kọ ọ́ ni àṣìṣe, fagile rẹ̀, tàbí pé àkókò rẹ̀ ti parí. Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́ọ̀sì tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ̀ mọ́ ibi yìí.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ìbéèrè yìí fún bọtínì rẹ. Bọtínì náà le má ní ààyè sí àpẹẹrẹ tàbí àpẹẹrẹ yìí, tàbí kí àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ nílò àrídájú.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Àì sí àwoṣe "%1$s" láti ọ̀dọ̀ %2$s fún bọ́tìni rẹ. Yan àwoṣe miiran nínú ètò AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ ko ni awoṣe "%1$s" ninu. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI, tabi sọ eto rẹ di tuntun pẹlu wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s nfi opin si bi o ṣe yara to fun bọtini rẹ lati fi awọn ibeere ranṣẹ. Duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o tun gbiyanju si tun, tabi gbe opin oṣuwọn rẹ soke pẹlu wọn.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s nírírí awọn iṣoro ni akoko yii (aiṣiṣẹ tabi fifuye lori apa wọn). Ko si ohun ti ko tọ si pẹlu awọn eto rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi laipẹ.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí kan tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí i, kàn sí ìmọ̀ títìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti bọtini ifibọ yii ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju si tun; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju lati ṣẹlẹ, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Àṣàyàn (Tí ó ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Fi bọtínì kan pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí kọ́kọ́.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Bọtini rẹ ṡe iṣẹ, ṣugbọn olupese naa ko ṣe atkojọ awoṣe ọrọ kankan fun un. Fi awoṣe kan kun fun ara rẹ ni isalẹ.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s ti fesi ni lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'A ko gba ipa olumulo re laaye lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Bi oludari re lere.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ojula yii ti de opin inawo AI rẹ fun oṣu yii. Alabojuto le gbe e soke ninu awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ayé yìí ti dé òpin ìwọ̀n oṣooṣù rẹ̀ fún àwọn ìbéèrè AI. Alákòóso kan lè gbé e sókè nínú àwọn ètò AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati idiwo','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Akọọlẹ, awọn opin ati awọn aṣẹ ipa wulo fun AI ti a lo nipasẹ: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn owó náà jẹ́ ìṣirò fún ìgbà díẹ̀, tí a ṣe láti ara àwọn owó tí a tẹ̀ jáde; àwọn àwoṣe tíkò ní owó tí a mọ̀ jẹ́ òfìfo.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: %1$s àwọn ìbéèrè, nípa %2$s.','When'=>'Nígbà tí','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'Lo fun','Model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn àmì tó wọlé / tó jáde','About'=>'Nipa','Result'=>'Èsi','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Àwòn ìbéèrè AI kò tíì sẹlẹ̀ rí.','Done'=>'Ti parọ̀','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Ìwọ̀nná owó tó ń ná lọ́dọọdún (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ láìsí ààlà. AI yóò dúró fún ìkùn oṣù náà nígbà tí iye owó náà bá dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìpín àwọn ìbéèrè fún oṣù kan','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo fún àìní opin.','Who may use AI'=>'Ta ni o le lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Má sàmì kankan láti jẹ́ kí olúkúlùkù tó lè lo àwọn ẹ̀yà ara àfikún náà lo AI. Àwọn alákòóso lè lo o nígbà gbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fipamọ awọn ààrọ̀ ati awọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Awon opin ati awon ase ti wa ni fipamọ.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Asẹ yẹn kii ṣe ọkan ninu awọn ede aaye yii.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ irú àkóbá kan náà pẹ̀lu èyí tí a kọ́kọ́ ṣe.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Yan ọkan ninu awọn ede miiran ti o wa lori aaye naa.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Awọn ìwé afọwọkọ ti iboju abojuto sonu ninu ẹ̀dà yìí ti fọ́ọ̀mù ìfikún naa. Tun fi sii lati inu àpò ti a ti tu silẹ.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ibùjoko yìí nílò JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Yan ede kan','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ náà gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni kò gbọ́dọ̀ sọ orúkọ plugin náà.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe koodu ede. Lo agbegbe WordPress kan bi fr_FR tabi de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ o kere ju èdè kan.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'A kò gba ọ laaye lati tumọ ohun yii.','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Ohun kan náà ti wà nígbà kan náà nínú èdè yẹn.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Ẹrọ ìtumọ̀ yẹn kò sí lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan, ìpadàbẹ́yìn aládàáṣe ati àwọn ààlà ìnáwó jẹ́ àwọn ànímọ́ Tranzly Pro.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Gbogbo èdè gbọdọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀kan nínú àwọn èdè ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà, pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀ tó wà látọwọ́.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Àtòjọ ìtìlẹ́yìn le sọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ tó wà nìkan.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Àpèjọ alápá kan lóṣù jẹ́ iye kan ní US dọ́là, òdo tàbí jẹ́ bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, fún ẹ̀rọ kan tó wà.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a fẹ́ràn àti ohùn fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ ẹ̀ya ara Tranzly Pro. Àtòjọ àwọn nǹkan tí a kò gbọdọ̀ túmọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀fẹ́.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'A gbọdọ ṣajọ awọn titẹ sii akọọlẹ ọrọ nipasẹ ọkan ninu awọn ede aaye naa.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'A ti n ṣeto ohùn (Tone) fún èdè ojula kọọkan: aiyipada ìfọ̀kanbẹlẹ, diẹ tabi ju bẹẹ lọ, pẹlu awọn ilana aṣayan.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Iye fún %s kò sí nínú àwọn àṣàyàn tí a gbà láèyè.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Kò sí ìlànà ìpìlẹ̀ (background queue) lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Iṣẹ ìtumọ̀ kan ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹni tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀, nítorí náà olùlò gbọ́dọ̀ ti wọlé.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Kò sí ohun kankan tí o ní àṣẹ láti túmọ̀ sí inú àṣàyàn yẹn.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Ohun yẹn kii ṣe apakan iṣẹ iṣtumọ kan.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'A kỢ fẹ́ kí o yí ìtumọ̀ yẹn padà.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ nǹkọ̀ kan náà yìí ti ní ẹ̀dà %1$s kan tẹ́lẹ̀ (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Ohun kan kò lè jẹ́ ìtumọ̀ ara rẹ̀.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Ohun kan náà ti jẹ́ ìtumọ̀ nǹkan mìíràn tẹ́lẹ̀. Yọ ìsopọ̀ rẹ̀ kúrò kọ́kọ́.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'A kò lè fipamọ́ ọna aṣojú ìtumọ̀ náà.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'A kò lè ṣe ìtumọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ yẹn níhìn-ín.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'A ko le tumọ ọrọ media yẹn nibi.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Ìtúmọ̀ lè jẹ́ kí á gbé jáde tàbí kí á fi sílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọọ́lẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'A kò yọ̀ǹda fún ọ láti gbé irú àkó-kọ́pù báyìí jáde.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Nǹkan yìí ti wà ní kíkọ ní èdè yẹn tẹ́lẹ̀.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'A è yí ìtumọ̀ yìí padà (tàbí a kó o wọlé), nítorí náà ó ní ààbò. Ṣí i láti tún tumọ̀ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Kò tíì sí ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀ kankan tí a ti ṣètò. Fi bọ́tìnnì kan kún fún ọ̀kan nínú Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Ẹrọ ìtumọ̀ yẹn kò tíì ṣètò: fi kún bọ́tìnnì rẹ̀ kọ́kọ́.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Awon nkan kann na ni iṣẹ miiran n tumọ lọwọlọwọ; ohun yii yoo lo idahun yẹn.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Kò sí ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀ kan tí ó lè mú ohun èlò yìí.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Ẹrọ náà kò dá ìtumọ̀ padà fún apá kan nínú ohun èlò yìí. Kò sí ohun tí a yí padà.','AI model'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Àwòṣe AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s nira lọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ báyìí. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan si ní kíákíà, tàbí lo ẹ̀rọ mìíràn.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Oju-wẹẹti rẹ ko le de ọdọ %s. Ṣayẹwo pe o le ṣe awọn asopọ ti njade, lẹhinna tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s kọ bọtọ́nisì API rẹ. Ṣayẹwo bọtọ́nisì na ni Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Akọọlẹ %s rẹ ti lo ipin tabi iwọntunwọnsi rẹ tan. Fikun-un pẹlu wọn, tabi lo ẹ̀rọ miiran.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s bi wa pe ki a dinku. A o tun gbiyanju rẹ laifọwọyi.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ yìí ti gùn jù fún %s ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan soso. Pín àwọn ohun inú rẹ̀, tàbí kí o lo ẹ̀rọ mìíràn.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s kọ lati tumọ akoonu yii. Gbiyanju ẹrọ miiran, tabi tumọ rẹ pẹlu ọwọ.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s ko tumọ ede yii. Yan ẹ̀rọ miiran fun un.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Awon owo ti a fi si eka %s ti pe osu yii, nitorina ko si ohun miiran ti a ran si. Mu owo na goke ni Tranzly → Engines, tabi duro de osu to n bo.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Ìtumọ̀ pẹ̀lú %s kùnà fún ìdí kan tí Tranzly kò lè mọ̀. Àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ rẹ̀ wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yìí.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ ẹ̀rọ (engine id) gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà kékeré, nọ́mbà, àti àmì iyọkuro (hyphens).','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'bọtìnì ìwé-àṣẹ','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'A ko tii sọ olumulo kan pọ mọ iwe-aṣẹ naa, eyiti o ṣe pataki lati ṣe idiwọ imuṣiṣẹ laisi aṣẹ. Lati sọ iwe-aṣẹ naa fun olumulo rẹ, o gba lati pin orukọ kikun ati adirẹsi imeeli ti olumulo WordPress rẹ.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'awọn aaye ti a mẹnuba loke','Account'=>'Akawunti','Account Details'=>'Alaye Akọọlẹ','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Àsọkọ ti wà fún ìmúṣẹ. Jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò imeeli rẹ kí o sì tẹ ìjápọ̀ náà láti mú àsọkọ rẹ ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́yìn náà tún fi fọ́ọ̀mù alábàákẹ́gbẹ́ sílẹ̀.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ lati dapọ %1$s sinu %2$s?','Actions'=>'Àwọn Ìgbésẹ̀','Activate'=>'Mú ṣiṣẹ́','Activate Free Version'=>'Mú Ẹ̀dọ̀ Ọ̀fẹ́ Ṣiṣẹ́','Activate License'=>'Muu iwe-alase ṣiṣẹ','activate a license here'=>'mú iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ nibi','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Jọwọ tẹ bọtọ̀ ìwé-àṣẹ ti o gba ninu imeeli lẹhin rira naa:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Muu iwe-alase ṣiṣẹ lori gbogbo awọn aaye ninu nẹtiwọki naa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Mú ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo àwọn ojú-wẹ́bù tó ń dúró de ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Ẹya ti a sanwo fún %1$s ti wà lórí ẹ̀rọ tẹ́lẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ mú un ṣiṣẹ́ láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í jẹ àǹfààní àwọn ànímọ́ %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Ẹya ti a sanwo fún %1$s ti wà lórí ẹ̀rọ náà tẹ́lẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ lọ sí %2$s láti mú un ṣiṣẹ́ kí o sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í jẹ àǹfààní àwọn ẹ̀yà %3$s náà.','Activate this add-on'=>'Mú àfikún yìí ṣiṣẹ́','Activate %s'=>'Mú %s ṣiṣẹ','Activate %s features'=>'Mú àwọn ẹ̀yà %s ṣiṣẹ́','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Parí Ìmúṣẹ " %s" Bayìí','Activate %s Plan'=>'Mú Ètò %s ṣiṣẹ','Activated'=>'Ti ṣiṣẹ lọwọ','Activating'=>'Ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́','Activating license'=>'Ìṣiṣẹ́ ìwé-àṣẹ lọ́wọ́','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'A ti mú àkáwù rẹ ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú ètò %s lórí ìnáwó náà.','active add-onActive'=>'Gbíṣẹ́','Add another domain'=>'Fi domain miiran kun un','Add-Ons'=>'Àwọn Ohun Èlò Ìfikún','Add Ons for %s'=>'Àwọn Àfikún fún %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'A ko le gbe àkọọkan àwọn àfikún wá. Ó ṣe e ṣe kí o jẹ́ aṣìṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa, jọ̀wọ́ gbiyanju láti padà bọ̀ lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','Add-On'=>'Àfikún','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s jẹ àfikún tó níyelẹ̀ nìkan. O ní láti rà ìwé-àṣẹ kan kọ́kọ́ kí o tó mú ẹ̀ka-ìṣètò yìí ṣiṣẹ́.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'A ti yọọ tita %s Add-on yẹn daradara.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully 