 ṣe deede si.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Nitorinaa o le tun lo iwe-ašẹ naa nigbati %s ko ba si ni sise mo.','Subscription'=>'Ìforúkọṣílẹ̀','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s yoo ma ran data ìwé àṣẹ pàtàkì sí %2$s léraléra láti ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ohun àmúṣe àti àwọn àfikún ààbò, àti láti mọ̀ dájú pé ìwé àṣẹ rẹ wúlò.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%1$s ti %2$s wa.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Lati ri daju pe ohun gbogbo n ṣiṣẹ pọ daradara ati lati yago fun awọn aiyede pẹlu awọn afikun ati awọn akori ti o fi sori ẹrọ.','Trial'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ ìdánwò','View %s State'=>'Wo Ipo %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Alaye Ipilẹ %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Bẹẹni, %2$s jẹ ẹda ti %4$s fun idi idanwo, ipele, tabi idagbasoke.','You have a %s license.'=>'O ni ìwé àṣẹ %s kan.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'O ti ra iwe-aşẹ %s kan.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'O yẹ ki o gba imeeli ìfìdí-mulẹ̀ fún %1$s sí àpótí ìfiránṣẹ́ rẹ ní %2$s. Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dajú pé o tẹ bọ́tìnnì tó wà nínú imeeli yẹn láti %3$s.','days'=>'àwọn ọjọ́','deactivating'=>'ń yọ kúrò nínú iṣẹ́','hour'=>'wakati','hours'=>'àkókò wákàtí','license'=>'ìwé àṣẹ','optional'=>'a yàn láàyè','products'=>'àwọn ọjà','skip'=>'fò kọjá','subscription'=>'ìforúkọ sílẹ̀','trial'=>'ìdánwò','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ń mú ṣiṣẹ́','as software licenseLicense'=>'Iwe-ašẹ','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ko sí','close windowDismiss'=>'Pa kuro','like websitesSites'=>'Àwọn ojula wẹbù','nounPricing'=>'Iye owo','trial periodTrial'=>'Idanwo','verbOpt In'=>'Gba Ilọkan','verbOpt Out'=>'Jade kuro','verbSkip'=>'Fò já sí','verbUpgrade'=>'Ṣe agbega','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s sẹ́yìn','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tí a kọ́ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde %s','Tranzly website'=>'Wọ́bìsáìtì Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'oju opo wẹẹbù Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Pro ati iye owó wọn','Languages'=>'Àwọn Èdè','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Èdè àkọkọ ni èdè tí a kọ ohun àkóópọ̀ rẹ sí. Àwọn alábèwò lè yí padà pẹ̀lú bálóòkì ìyípadà èdè.','(default)'=>'(àìṣàtúnṣe)','Locale code'=>'Koodu agbegbe','For example fr_FR'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Oruko (ti ko dandan)','For example Français'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Français','Add language'=>'Fi ede kun','Front-end output'=>'Ìṣajù ojú-òpó wẹ́bù','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàásì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà kò ní fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. 1 sí 8 lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn àfikún Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹbi awọn imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduroṣinṣin nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyí padà lori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon eya beta ni a n se afihan won fun awon fifi sori Pro ti o ni iwe-ase ti o si ni isopọ mo iroyin won. Ni kete ti o ba ni isopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Iroyin.','Save settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò pamọ́','First engine that is set up'=>'Ẹ̀rọ àkọ́kọ́ tí a ṣètò','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Bọtìnì náà ti fipamọ́. A ti fi ìkọ̀gbọ̀nsẹ̀ pamọ́ kò sì ní hàn mọ́ láé.','Engine settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto ẹ̀rọ náà.','Glossary saved.'=>'A ti fi Glossary pamọ́.','Your keys'=>'Awọn kọ́ọ̀sì rẹ','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly npe awọn iṣẹ itumọ pẹlu akọọlẹ tirẹ. A n fipamọ awọn kọọti ti a ti paroko sinu ibi ipamọ data rẹ, a si n ran wọn nikan si iṣẹ ti wọn jẹ ti wọn. A n ṣeto awọn kọọti awoṣe AI ninu awọn eto AI.','%s API key'=>'Bọtììlì API %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'A ti fipamọ: %s. Tẹ bọtọ titun sẹ́ ti o ba fẹ ropo rẹ, tabi fi aaye ti o ṣofo pamọ lati yọ kuro.','No key saved.'=>'Ko si bọtini ti o fipamọ.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Agbègbè Azure (fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣóńṣó fún ohun àmúṣọrọ̀ kárí ayé)','Save key'=>'Fi bọtini pamọ','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Ṣàyẹ̀wọ́n lílò DeepL mi','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'%1$s ninu %2$s àwọn ohun kikọ ni a ti lo ni àsìkò ìwé-owó yii.','Which engine translates'=>'Èwo nínú ẹ̀rọ ló ń túmọ̀','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Kò tíì sí êngìn tí a ṣètò. Fipamọ́ bọ́tìsì kan sí òkè (tàbí kí o ṣètò àwòṣe AI kan) láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìtumọ̀.','Default engine'=>'Ẹrọ aiyipada','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Ẹrọ kan pato fun ede kọọkan, atilẹyin adaṣe ati opin inawo osooṣu jẹ awọn ẹya Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Ẹrọ fún %s','The default engine'=>'Ẹnjini aiyipada','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Tí ẹ̀rọ kan bá kuna tàbí tí ó dé ìwọ̀n, gbìyànjú àwọn wọ̀nyí lẹ́yìn náà, ní ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ yìí','Monthly spending caps'=>'Àwọn ìnáwó oṣooṣù','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Nigbati ẹ̀rọ kan ba de opin rẹ̀, kò sí ohun miiran ti a fi ranṣẹ si titi di oṣu ti n bọ ati pe ijabọ itumọ ti o kuna sọ idi rẹ. Fi silẹ ni ṣofo fun ko si opin.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (ti ná lọ oṣù yìí: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Fi awọn àpòòpọ̀ pamọ́','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Giolosari ati Awọn ọrọ ti a ko tumọ ri','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Ẹ má ṣe túmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ wọ̀nyí rárá (ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Awọn orukọ ami iyasọtọ ati ọja ma n wa bi wọ́n ṣe wà, pẹ̀lu gbogbo ẹ̀rọ.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Awọn itumọ ti o fẹ ati ohun ohun fun ede kọọkan jẹ awọn ẹya ara Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a fẹ́ràn (ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan: term = translation)','Formality'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ Ìbáṣepọ̀','Default'=>'Àìṣàyàn','Formal'=>'Aṣa ibùwọlé','Informal'=>'Tirẹ-ṣe-ti-o-wọ́pọ̀','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Àwọn ìlànà ìrísí (àwọn olùgbọ́, ohùn àmì-ọjà)','Save glossary'=>'Fi ìtumọ pamọ','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'A bẹrẹ iṣẹ pẹlu %d awọn itumọ lati ṣe. O nṣiṣẹ ni abẹlẹ: o le pa oju-iwe yii.','Queued again.'=>'A tún ti gbé sínú àtòjọ.','Running'=>'Ó ń lọ','Finished'=>'Ti parẹ','Translate in the background'=>'Túmọ̀ ní ìpìlẹ̀ adani','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Fi ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ sílẹ̀ ní tàbù Ìtumọ (Engines) ní àkọ́kọ́.','Translate every'=>'Tumọ gbogbo rẹ','Into'=>'Sínú','With'=>'Pẹlu','Each language’s own engine'=>'Èrò kọ̀ọ̀kan fún èdè rẹ̀','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Ṣe àtẹ̀jáde àwọn ìtumọ̀ náà (bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ a óò fi wọ́n pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọọ́lẹ̀ àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀)','Estimate the cost'=>'Fojú aisiye iye owo naa','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d àwọn atẹ̀jáde, %2$s àwọn álífábẹ̀tì. Iye owó fún ẹ̀rọ yìí kò mọ tẹ́lẹ̀.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ %1$d, àwọn àlífábẹ̀tì %2$s: ó fẹ́rẹ̀ẹ́ jẹ́ $%3$s lórí àkántì ara rẹ.','Start translating'=>'Bẹrẹ titumọ','Jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Ko si awọn iṣẹ itumọ kankan sibẹṣẹ.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Iṣẹ %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ti a tumọ, %3$d kuna, %4$d foju fo (aabo tabi ti wa ni ede yẹn tẹlẹ)','Stop this job'=>'Dúró iṣẹ yii','See what failed and why'=>'Wo ohun ti o kuna ati idi rẹ̀','Content'=>'Akoonu','Language'=>'Èdè','What went wrong'=>'Kí ni ó ṣe aṣiṣe','Fix it'=>'Gbọ̀ rẹ̀','Retry with'=>'Tun gbiyanju pẹlu','The same engine'=>'Ẹrọ kan náà','Retry'=>'Tun gbiyanju','Translate by hand'=>'Tumọ pẹlu ọwọ','Languages and settings'=>'Àwọn èdè àti ètò','Engines'=>'Àwọn Ẹrọ','Translation jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi ede keji kun labẹ Tranzly ni akojọ aṣayan abojuto, yoo si han nibi.','Switcher'=>'Aṣọ̀yípadà','Accessible label'=>'Àwọn àmì tó ṣeé wọlé','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Aláyípadà èdè','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Awọn ọna aṣopọ si oju-iwe yii ni olukuluku awọn ede aaye naa. Ko ni han ohunkohun titi ti a o fi ṣe akoስተ awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹ lọ.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'Olutiraka','block keywordtranslation'=>'Ìtumọ̀']];